(text "A2OOI_J2: AND-OR-INVERT (AOI22), Y = ~((A & B) | (C & D)). Two 6Zh2B on one plate, Ra 15k.\nA, C on g1; B, D on g3. Screens Rg2 15k from +150 V; Cb 15 pF on each g3 (g3 Miller, sch/logic/NAND2_J2/README.md).\nA, B, C, D: LV (1 = +10 V, 0 = -20 V). Y: HV (1 = +150 V, 0 = +50 V); one divider per output net.\nInput divider C1 per grid: A, C (pentode g1) 2.7 pF; B, D (g3) 6.8 pF.\nSimulated, fanout 2/6/10: worst arc 209/326/418 ns. Heater 6.3 V: 2 x 0.2 A on H1/H2.\nPage: sch/logic/A2OOI_J2/README.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "27265142-cc61-4acb-b518-2f573455b23b"))

